#12712
vulcano~
Vulcano~
The mighty Vulcano, the God of Earth, is watching you.~
You can't compare his dimensions with anything you've seen before.
You could say he is a giant among giants.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_INFRARED
0 S
95 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD|BODY_HAND|BODY_FOOT 0d0+15000 30d2+50
347725 780605
POS_RESTING POS_RESTING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 99~
if level($n) < 75
  shout $n is not allowed to deal with me now!
  shout Maybe I will allow $n to visit me later!
  mpquiet on
  mptransfer $n 12701
  mpquiet off
else
  say Hello mortal. What can I do for you?
endif
~
>hitprcnt_prog 40~
if rand(80)
  cast "heal" 
  cast "heal"
else
  if rand(50)
    cast "fireball" $n
  endif
endif
~
>death_prog 99~
shout No mortal is powerful enough to see my corpse!
say You are strong enough to have a piece of my might.
remove lava
drop lava
say But you have to survive my last trick
mpecho Vulcano jumps in the air and lands heavily on the ground
cast "earthquake"
mpecho Vulcano disappears into the rocks.
mpquiet on
mpgoto 12750
mpquiet off
~
>give_prog I12704~
if rand(80)
  say I guess you want the necklace then.
  say OK! I'll make a wisdom necklace for you.
  mpjunk bunch
  mpecho Vulcano gets a needle and some wire from a little box.
  mpecho He makes a necklace with the feathers you gave him.
  mpoload 12705
  say Here is your necklace.  Use it wisely.
  drop wisdom
endif
~
|

